# Reactions for the slice villagers (T-091): small remarks that wait for the player after something happens in the world.
# Each queues for up to ttl days, plays once when you talk to them, and cannot repeat for the same villager inside the cooldown.

reaction react.wren.spring
on season:spring
npcs wren
ttl 4
plays react.wren.spring.d
say react.wren.spring.d wren: Spring! The whole village smells like mud and good intentions. I love it. Don't tell the mud.

reaction react.wren.winter
on season:winter
npcs wren
ttl 4
plays react.wren.winter.d
say react.wren.winter.d wren: First snow, and my stove has already started a feud with the draft. Come in. Pick a side.

reaction react.wren.harvest
on quest.done:tut_harvest
npcs wren
ttl 5
plays react.wren.harvest.d
say react.wren.harvest.d wren: I heard you harvested something! Everyone's talking. Mostly me. Show me what grew.

reaction react.wren.coins
on random:found_coins
npcs wren
ttl 3
plays react.wren.coins.d
say react.wren.coins.d wren: A little bird told me you found coins. The bird was me. I follow everything.

reaction react.hazel.spring
on season:spring
npcs hazel
ttl 4
plays react.hazel.spring.d
say react.hazel.spring.d hazel: The windows are open. (The pages like it.) Spring smells like paper.

reaction react.hazel.winter
on season:winter
npcs hazel
ttl 4
plays react.hazel.winter.d
say react.hazel.winter.d hazel: Snow. (The library is the warmest place in town.) Stay as long as you like.

reaction react.hazel.harvest
on quest.done:tut_harvest
npcs hazel
ttl 5
plays react.hazel.harvest.d
say react.hazel.harvest.d hazel: You grew something. (I'm told that's a skill.) I'd like to read about it.

reaction react.hazel.wren
on event:wren_heart4
npcs hazel
ttl 5
plays react.hazel.wren.d
say react.hazel.wren.d hazel: I heard a song from the saloon. (Through three walls.) It was terrible. I think she knew.

reaction react.bram.spring
on season:spring
npcs bram
ttl 4
plays react.bram.spring.d
say react.bram.spring.d bram: Hm. Spring. Plows are coming. Bring yours early.

reaction react.bram.winter
on season:winter
npcs bram
ttl 4
plays react.bram.winter.d
say react.bram.winter.d bram: Hm. Snow. Forge is warm. Sit if you like.

reaction react.bram.harvest
on quest.done:tut_harvest
npcs bram
ttl 5
plays react.bram.harvest.d
say react.bram.harvest.d bram: Hm. First harvest. Good. Your hoe held up. I noticed.

reaction react.bram.wren
on event:wren_heart4
npcs bram
ttl 5
plays react.bram.wren.d
say react.bram.wren.d bram: Hm. Wren sang. I heard. Don't tell her I listened.
